{
  "slug": "gcp-devkit",
  "name": "Gcp Devkit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Generate Terraform for Google Cloud, debug Cloud Run, GKE, and Cloud Functions failures, audit IAM, and scaffold Cloud Run deployments.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**, **3 agents**, **3 commands** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `cloud-run-deploy` (Scaffold everything needed to deploy a service to Cloud Run), `firestore-rules` (Generate or audit Firestore security rules), `gcloud-debug` (Diagnose common GCP failures on Cloud Run, GKE, and Cloud Functions), `gke-manifest` (Generate GKE-tailored Kubernetes manifests that use Workload Identity, BackendConfig, and Ingress with Google-managed certificates), `iam-audit` (Audit IAM bindings on a GCP project for overly broad roles and stale service account keys), `terraform-gcp` (Generate idiomatic Terraform for common GCP resources)\n- **Agents** (3): `gcp-forensics` (Use when a GCP workload is failing (Cloud Run 5xx or cold starts, GKE pods in CrashLoopBackOff or…), `migration-planner` (Use for an explicitly requested multi-step migration plan to GCP from AWS or Azure), `terraform-author` (Use when writing, restructuring, or reviewing Terraform for GCP (Cloud Run, GKE, GCS, Cloud SQL, Pub/Sub, Artifact Registry,…)\n- **Commands** (3): `doctor` (Check the local GCP toolchain), `full-audit` (Run the full GCP audit pass in one command), `project` (Show the active GCP project, its lifecycle state, and the projects the current account can access)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install gcp-devkit@claude-community` from `mohitkale/gcp-devkit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
